 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "Outside is done in Black and the paint is in good shape with some small chips in the paint and small door dents but look good. There is damage on the driver's seat and one of the vents in the center of the dash is broke see photos. The A/C is not cold and would need to be checked out. The car also would need new tires as the tires are way under 4/32 and the wheels show curb damage and one center cap missing. Rear PDC is working and so are all the power windows, power locks, and sunroof. There is no dip stick on this BMW as they use the on board system and there is no codes at the time of the check out."
  }
